  "definition": "Sport science, in this source, refers to the academic field of Physical Activity and Sport Science (PASS), meaning the area of higher education centered on physical activity and sport. Here it is discussed as a degree choice shaped by students’ interests, expected career outcomes, social support, and gender stereotypes.",
